      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, worker shards are 1-indexed (1..shard_count), while 0/unset represents the unsharded build or the parent orchestrator build:\n\n- In chromiumos/platform/ec, shard_projects() validates `1 \u003c\u003d opts.shard_index \u003c\u003d opts.shard_count` and computes `(opts.shard_index - 1) * chunk_size`: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/76c3cdd4d4a3426eb0e103bef9c446d3631de510/zephyr/scripts/firmware_builder_lib.py#108 (and `--shard-index` is defined as \"1-based index of the current shard to execute\" at https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/76c3cdd4d4a3426eb0e103bef9c446d3631de510/zephyr/scripts/firmware_builder_lib.py#407, matching Twister `TWISTER_SUBSET\u003d{opts.shard_index}/{opts.shard_count}` at https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/76c3cdd4d4a3426eb0e103bef9c446d3631de510/zephyr/firmware_builder.py#789).\n- In chromiumos/infra/recipes, the parent build runs when `shard_count \u003e 1 and not shard_index` and schedules worker shards with `for i in range(1, shard_count + 1): props[\"shard_index\"] \u003d i`: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/infra/recipes/+/7f1bdd0d53f0d97ec241f7acffca165505585a90/recipes/build_firmware.py#183",
